  "system": {
    "description": "<p>A calling for one who would unveil the greatest secrets of magic. </p><p>So much about the world eludes mortal understanding, and you yearn above all to know its great and ancient secrets. Through rigorous trial and tireless study of your predecessors, you may learn to harness elusive energies that few others can comprehend. The hidden workings of the mortal mind, the power to bend and break the laws of natural science, the secrets of the many hidden worlds and their denizens- none of this knowledge is beyond your enterprising reach. Yet beware, for these things come at a great and inevitable cost, and only true dedication can yield insight into such power.</p>",
